\q1
\v 12 \add That was\add* when they were few in number—
\q1 so few, and were strangers to the area.
\q1
\v 13 They wandered from country to country
\q1 \add and\add* from one kingdom to another.
\q1
\v 14 He didn’t allow others to oppress them.
\q1 He \add even\add* scolded kings on their account.
\q1
\v 15 He told them not to touch his chosen \add leaders\add*,
